  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3542": "Title: 鸭犬……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3543": "Description: 寻找鸭犬！（它留下了一股气味，像是微风拂过草原。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3544": "Description: 寻找鸭犬！（它留下了一股气味，像是……高山上的草甸？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3545": "Description: 寻找鸭犬！（它留下了一股气味，像是……沼泽？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3546": "Description: 寻找鸭犬！（它留下了一股气味，像是……被烈日烤晒的荒地。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3547": "Title: 贪得太多，挖得太深",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3548": "Description: 调查尘风峡谷的矿井，寻找奥克塔维娅提到的作祟之物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3549": "Title: 可疑情报",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3550": "Description: 在飞空艇上找到尼古拉，把飘到甲板的信交给他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3551": "Title: 又一个山洞？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3552": "Description: 在尼古拉世界的东北山区寻找洞穴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3553": "Title: 我们在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3554": "Description: 操作朱娜探索周围。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3555": "Title: 逃离梦境",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3556": "Description: 帮助朱娜找到同伴，将他们从噩梦中唤醒！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3557": "Title: 帝国边缘",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3558": "Description: 前往洞穴东北边缘，验证科黛莉娅的猜想。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3559": "Title: 灼光者",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3560": "Description: 面对并击败自古栖居于此的元素灵。",
